  "heading": "# Synthetic calibration",
  "lead": "For the disconnected synthetic demonstration:",
  "action": "- Rotate the synthetic amber calibration ring.",
  "condition": "- Condition: the synthetic motor must be disconnected.",
  "caveat": "- Caveat: never apply this step to the connected production rig.",
  "other": "- Record the independent synthetic cobalt reference.",
  "raws": {
    "a.md": "# Synthetic calibration\n\nFor the disconnected synthetic demonstration:\n\n- Rotate the synthetic amber calibration ring.\n- Condition: the synthetic motor must be disconnected.\n  - Verify the synthetic cable is isolated.\n- Caveat: never apply this step to the connected production rig.\n- Example: the offline synthetic bench.\n- Record the independent synthetic cobalt reference.",
    "b.md": "# Synthetic calibration\n\nFor the disconnected synthetic demonstration:\n\n- Rotate the synthetic amber calibration ring.\n- Condition: only the sealed synthetic simulator permits this step.\n  - Verify the synthetic cable is isolated.\n- Caveat: never use this step on the open synthetic bench.\n- Example: the offline synthetic bench.\n- Record the independent synthetic cobalt reference.",
    "copy.md": "# Synthetic calibration\n\nFor the disconnected synthetic demonstration:\n\n- Rotate the synthetic amber calibration ring.\n- Condition: the synthetic motor must be disconnected.\n  - Verify the synthetic cable is isolated.\n- Caveat: never apply this step to the connected production rig.\n- Example: the offline synthetic bench.\n- Record the independent synthetic cobalt reference."
  },
